ass=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/003-1e452f5dd6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/003-1e452f5dd6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n株主大会之名下的\n各种\n有趣展开！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/004-8741c8a5a1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/004-8741c8a5a1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n挑战精神十足！\n真是学到很多！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nFROGMAN先生的\n品味\n闪闪发光！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/005-775370eb04.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/005-775370eb04.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"265\" height=\"603\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n哎呀——\n太有趣了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n笑个不停，转眼就是两小时\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好多伴手礼！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n除此之外，还有印着“瓜”字的\nT恤！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今天\nFRIGMAN先生\n正好过生日，\n就更加值得庆祝了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n生日快乐！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n久违地\n大笑了一场（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n回程时的\n台场也很漂亮哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/008-05e739910c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/008-05e739910c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"905\" height=\"483\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……\n当然\n也给自己买了伴手礼（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/009-37767042a6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/009-37767042a6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n工作时\n用用看（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n下回再见！","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">10周年</div>\nおめでとうございます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/001-f88aa4640e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/001-f88aa4640e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n大好きな\n鷹の爪団\n10周年イベント\n行って来ました！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/002-42214341ad.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/002-42214341ad.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"498\" height=\"356\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nイベント会場は\n台場のメディアージュ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/003-1e452f5dd6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/003-1e452f5dd6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n株主総会という名の\n様々な\n面白い展開！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/004-8741c8a5a1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/004-8741c8a5a1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャレンジ精神旺盛！\nむっちゃ勉強になります！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nFROGMANさんの\nセンスが\nキラキラ光ってました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/005-775370eb04.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/005-775370eb04.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"265\" height=\"603\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいやー\n面白かった！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n笑いまくった\nあっという間の2時間\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nたくさんのお土産！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれ以外に瓜と描かれた\nTシャツも！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n本日\nFRIGMANさんの\nお誕生日ということで\nさらにめでたく！\n\n<br>\n\n\nお誕生日おめでとうございます！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n久しぶりに\nたくさん笑いました（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n帰りの\nお台場も綺麗でしたよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/008-05e739910c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/008-05e739910c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"905\" height=\"483\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\nもちろん\n自分へのお土産（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/009-37767042a6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2659314/009-37767042a6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n仕事で\n使おう（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！"}}